ys (AllianceBernstein, Vistra) and innovative healthcare exposure (Tempus AI).     - Per the user prompt instructions (*"Argue for copying the visible buys, using range midpoints. Do not submit orders."*), no trade execution is required at this stage.  RESULT: Argued the bull case for copying visible buys from Filing 20033725 using range midpoints without submitting orders.' trace=/Users/robertgrzesik/Library/Caches/lumibot/1.0/agent_runtime/traces/bull/8426c89de91be95d55e58815434b66bcbd6ecc784254f5617bc20e05175a12ea-20260923035331377243.json
