$375,000.50}{\\$4,925,062.50} \\approx \\mathbf{7.61\\%}$   4. **AMZN (Amazon - Options)**: $\\frac{\\$175,000.50}{\\$4,925,062.50} \\approx \\mathbf{3.55\\%}$   5. **NVDA (NVIDIA - Stock)**: $\\frac{\\$375,000.50}{\\$4,925,062.50} \\approx \\mathbf{7.61\\%}$   6. **TEM (Tempus AI - Stock)**: $\\frac{\\$75,005.50}{\\$4,925,062.50} \\approx \\mathbf{1.52\\%}$   7. **VST (Vistra Corp. - Stock)**: $\\frac{\\$175,000.50}{\\$4,925,062.50} \\approx \\mathbf{3.55\\%}$  *(Note: In accordance with instructions, no orders were submitted.)*  RESULT: Assigned account weights from filing 20033725 range midpoints (AB 60.91%, GOOGL Stock 15.23%, GOOGL Options 7.61%, NVDA 7.61%, AMZN Options 3.55%, VST 3.55%, TEM 1.52%) without submitting orders." trace=/Users/robertgrzesik/Library/Caches/lumibot/1.0/agent_runtime/traces/interpreter/d8e1bc1892ed898b4cdb4f8831fbc0dd709335d7b775d26036a55535634e6317-20260923035335001466.json
