azon provide robust balance sheets, cash generation, and scale. * **Diversification into High-Yield & Emerging Sectors (AB, VST, TEM)**:    * *AllianceBernstein (AB)* offers high-yielding asset management exposure and value characteristics.   * *Vistra Corp (VST)* captures structural energy demand and power generation dynamics essential for data center growth.   * *Tempus AI (TEM)* introduces high-growth healthcare technology exposure. * **Balanced Risk Profile via Range Midpoints**: Scaling capital allocations relative to these filing range midpoints ensures a balanced, diversified risk-adjusted exposure across market leaders without over-concentrating in a single sub-sector.  In accordance with instructions ("*Argue for copying the visible buys, using range midpoints. Do not submit orders.*"), no orders have been submitted.  RESULT: Argued the bull case for copying the visible buy transactions from Filing 20033725 using range midpoints, adhering strictly to temporal and no-order constraints.' trace=/Users/robertgrzesik/Library/Caches/lumibot/1.0/agent_runtime/traces/bull/819f8cc2c30e0f7c0c97ec13059072490f29af690a2df87c476057541cb4c352-20260923035403556469.json
